  "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mr. Arjun G S</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Assistant Professor</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Education Details</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>M.Tech Computer Engineering, JSS S&amp;T University, Mysuru.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>B.E ISE M I T, Mysuru, VTU.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Professional Experience</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Industry Experience – 5 years 8 months.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>MTS Software Engineer 2, NetApp, Bangalore. July 2018 - April 2023.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Intern, NetApp, Bangalore. July 2017 - July 2018.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Publication Details</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>International Journals:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"type\":\"1\"} -->\n<ol type=\"1\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>G S, Arjun, and P. D. Rashmi. \"One Time Keyboard (OTK) Authentication.\", IJIRST Vol 4, Issue 1 p 173-177</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->",
